# AI Writing Workspace — Manual QA Testing

## Project Overview

This project documents manual QA testing performed on a staging/preview environment of an AI-powered writing and planning workspace.

The goal of the testing was to evaluate core user workflows, identify functional issues, verify data persistence, test AI-assisted features, and document usability improvements.

> **Note:** The product name has been anonymized for portfolio purposes.

---

## Testing Scope

The following areas were tested:

* Board
* Draft
* Plan
* AI Chat
* Library
* Templates
* Split View
* Project / Manuscript management
* Poster / Cover management
* Navigation
* UI and UX behavior
* Data persistence
* AI Assistant workflows

---

