## Testing Approach

Testing was performed using realistic end-user workflows rather than testing individual UI elements in isolation.

The application was tested across different states and user actions, including:

* Opening and navigating Projects / Manuscripts
* Switching between Draft and Plan
* Creating and editing Draft content
* Refreshing pages to verify persistence
* Using the AI Assistant
* Testing AI-generated content
* Dragging and moving Board items
* Working with Templates
* Opening the same Draft in Split View
* Uploading and saving poster images
* Deleting Projects and checking related AI Chat state
* Starting new conversations
* Checking whether previous conversation context was retained
* Verifying UI feedback after user actions

Additional attention was given to state consistency after:

* Page refresh
* Navigation
* Reopening content
* Deletion
* Switching views
* Starting a new conversation
* Performing the same action in different UI states

