## Testing Summary

This project demonstrates a practical manual QA approach focused on real user workflows, application state, data persistence, AI-assisted functionality, and cross-feature behavior.

The testing process included exploratory testing, functional verification, regression checks, bug reproduction, UX evaluation, and evidence collection.

The findings were documented with reproducible steps, expected and actual results, and supporting evidence where available.

